Author: Konata <konata@KonatadeMacBook-Pro.local>
Date:   Wed Sep 2 00:01:46 2026 +0800

    feat(upgrade): 下载阶段可取消（本机/入口 job/转发目标），取消零残留
    
    - DELETE /api/system/upgrade：downloading 可取消（abort + 删 txn 目录与未校验缓存），executing 409 NOT_CANCELLABLE，idle 409 NOT_RUNNING
    - DELETE /api/system/upgrade/package?version= 丢弃暂存包；入口 job 取消于推送完成后自动调用
    - 入口 DELETE /api/mesh/nodes/:id/upgrade：取消本地 job（overlay UPGRADE_CANCELLED，随后可立即重发）或转发；旧目标 501 CANCEL_UNSUPPORTED
    - PUT 体中断即删 .part；崩溃半取消由下次启动 prune 修复；取消与收尾竞态由 controller 互斥保证不撕裂
    
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XhSLkyskLHdE1at75LomAV

